        "input_text": "What is the savings interest rate?",
        "started_at": "2026-11-20T09:38:56.067554+00:00",
        "output_text": "Our savings interest rates vary by product and terms. To get the exact current rate for your account, please check your online banking portal, review your account statements, or contact our customer service team. They can provide the most up-to-date details on high-yield savings accounts and other options.",
